        },
        {
          "id": "md_choice_full_settlement",
          "text": "用一笔较大的和解金今天结清工伤与欠薪，暂时不再区分生活预付和未来恶化费用。",
          "next": "md_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "meng_duan", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "meng_duan_full_settlement_requested", "value": true}
